    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d8-a1">

                <pb facs="0056" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg6"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 23.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Buchanan to Mr.
                            Gresham</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Ayres</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-04"><hi rendition="#italic">August 4,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Buchanan inquires, whether in view of incorrect valuations and high duties in
                    the tariff of Argentine on some prominent products of America, he is authorized
                    to secure, if possible, equitable adjustment in tariff law under
                    consideration.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
